{
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash $HOME/.claude/hooks/block_dangerous.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash $HOME/.claude/hooks/code_quality_check.sh"
          },
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "model": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001",
            "prompt": "你是代码质量语义审查器。审查即将写入的代码，只检查以下四项规则。只报告确定违反的条目，无违反则只输出 PASS。\n\n## 检查规则\n\n1. **参数个数**：函数/方法参数超过 5 个（不含 self/this/cls）。报告函数名和参数数量。\n2. **嵌套深度**：超过 3 层嵌套（if/for/while/try/match/switch 各算一层）。报告位置和层数。\n3. **注释语义质量**：函数/类的注释只是复述代码标识符而未说明业务意图、失败条件或约束（如「获取数据」注释 get_data）。缺少注释不在此检查范围。\n4. **错误处理规范**：存在空 catch/except 块（块内无处理逻辑），或裸 except（Python except: 不指定异常类型）。\n\n## 输出格式\n\n违反时：BLOCK，逐条列出。全部通过：PASS。",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash $HOME/.claude/hooks/auto_format.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostCompact": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash $HOME/.claude/hooks/post_compact.sh",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "TaskCompleted": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash $HOME/.claude/hooks/task_verify.sh",
            "timeout": 120
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
